        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A new employee in Distribution, once he/she reports to their station during the first year, will work thirty (30) days as a third person on a crew as determined by the Company. During the second year, he/she will work thirty (30) days as a third person on a crew as determined by the Company. They will also be scheduled for a minimum of one odd shift for the first six months as a third person the crew.",
